OL,3,ARapper Nicki Minaj joins Trump onstage
OL,4,Aat Michigan rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Nicki Minaj said US President
OL,7,FDonald Trump has "changed the energy of
OL,8,Fthe country" as she joined him at a
OL,9,FMichigan rally to stump for Republicans
OL,10,Fahead of the nationwide midterm
OL,11,Felections.
OL,13,F"He's given us a future to look forward
OL,14,Fto," she said, after Trump praised her
OL,15,Ffigure and called her on stage to
OL,16,Fspeak.
OL,18,FMinaj has called herself Trump's
OL,19,F"number one fan" despite criticising
OL,20,Fsome of his policies in his first term.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
