OL,3,ARapper Nicki Minaj joins Trump onstage
OL,4,Aat Michigan rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Michigan, Democratic Senate
OL,7,Fcandidate Abdul El-Sayed is locked in a
OL,8,Ftight race with Republican Mike Rogers
OL,9,Fwith just over a week to go before the
OL,10,Fmidterms. Former President Barack Obama
OL,11,Fheld a rally - one of the first in this
OL,12,Fcycle - with the Democrat on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
